{
 "<p><b>You have got mail!</b></p><p>A license file should have been sent to your email address. Upload the license file from the email to activate your UCS instance.</p>": "<p><b>您收到一封郵件!</b></p><p>授權檔應已寄送至您的電子郵件地址。請從郵件上傳該授權檔,以啟用您的 UCS 執行個體。</p>",
 "<p>Detailed usage information on Univention Management Console can be found in the UCS manual. The manual as well as further important information are available via the following links:</p>": "<p>關於 Univention Management Console 的詳細使用說明,請參閱 UCS 手冊。您可以透過下列連結取得手冊及其他重要資訊:</p>",
 "<p>Details about the activation of a UCS license can be found in the <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual-%(version)s.html#central:license\" target=\"_blank\">UCS manual</a>.</p>": "<p>關於 UCS 授權啟用的詳細說明,請參閱 <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual-%(version)s.html#central:license\" target=\"_blank\">UCS 手冊</a>。</p>",
 "<p>Leave the field empty to perform the activation at a later point in time via the user menu in top right corner.</p>": "<p>將此欄位留空,即可稍後透過右上角的使用者選單進行啟用。</p>",
 "<p>On UCS evaluation systems, anonymous usage statistics are created by default and sent to Univention. This allows to continuously adapt UCS to suit the practical needs of its users.</p><p>The information consists of UMC usage statistics and a one-time statistic on the hardware configuration. Details about the usage statistics and about its deactivation can be found in the <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual-%(version)s.html#central-management-umc:piwik\" target=\"_blank\">UCS manual</a>.</p><p>Usage statistics are automatically deactivated when importing a commercial license.</p>": "<p>在 UCS 評估系統上,預設會建立匿名使用統計並傳送給 Univention。這讓 UCS 能持續調整,以符合使用者的實際需求。</p><p>這些資訊包含 UMC 使用統計,以及一次性的硬體組態統計。關於使用統計及如何停用的詳細說明,請參閱 <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual-%(version)s.html#central-management-umc:piwik\" target=\"_blank\">UCS 手冊</a>。</p><p>匯入商業授權時,使用統計會自動停用。</p>",
 "<p>The license has been updated successfully.</p><p>You can now continue to use UMC, all applications in the Univention App Center are now available for installation on this system.</p>": "<p>授權已成功更新。</p><p>您現在可以繼續使用 UMC,Univention App Center 中的所有應用程式現在都可以安裝到此系統上。</p>",
 "<p>You may now enter a valid e-mail address in order to activate the UCS system to use the App Center. In the next step you can upload the license file that has been sent to your email address.</p>": "<p>您現在可以輸入有效的電子郵件地址,以啟用 UCS 系統來使用 App Center。下一步您可以上傳已寄送至您電子郵件地址的授權檔。</p>",
 "<ul><li><a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/\" target=\"_blank\">Online documentation</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.univention.com/products/support/community-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Community and support</a></li></ul>": "<ul><li><a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/\" target=\"_blank\">線上說明文件</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.univention.com/products/support/community-support/\" target=\"_blank\">社群與技術支援</a></li></ul>",
